# Manikineko Online Viewer

Phoenix Firestorm–based open-source viewer code for Manikineko Online.

---

## Disclaimers

**This is not Firestorm.**  
Manikineko Online is **not** affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with the Phoenix Firestorm Project, Firestorm Viewer, Second Life, or Linden Lab.

**This repository is only the open-source viewer code.**  
Proprietary or third-party code that we do not have the right to release is kept out of this tree. A **plugin / link-only** system is used so that such components are not mixed into Firestorm-derived sources and **do not affect compilation** of this viewer.

