---

## What this repo is

- Open-source viewer sources derived from Phoenix Firestorm.
- Intended as the compilable core of the Manikineko Online viewer.
- Plugins that cannot be open-sourced live outside this tree (link-only; they are not required to build this code).

## What this repo is not

- Not official Firestorm.
- Not a Second Life / Linden Lab product.
- Not a complete, finished client.
- Not a license to use Manikineko branding beyond credits.

